able-message-reformatting\\\" /><style type=\\\"text/css\\\" nonce=\\\"MAVm1owA\\\">\\n      :root {\\n        Color-scheme: light dark;\\n        supported-color-schemes:light dark;\\n      }\\n\\n      @font-face {\\n        font-family: 'Helvetica Neue';\\n        font-style: normal;\\n        font-weight: normal;\\n        src: url(https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/rsrc.php/yy/r/Z0i7jCfNgbu.woff2) format('woff2')\\n      }\\n\\n      .tp_body,\\n      .tp_body * {\\n        background-color: #FCF5EB;\\n      }\\n\\n      .wase_email_header_text,\\n      .wase_email_footer_text {\\n        color: #5B6368;\\n      }\\n\\n      .wase_email_body,\\n      .wase_email_body * {\\n        color: #111B21;\\n        background-color: #FFFFFF;\\n      }\\n\\n      .wase_email_body h2 {\\n        font-weight: 400;\\n        font-size: 22px;\\n        line-height: 28px;\\n        margin: 0px;\\n      }\\n\\n      .wase_email_body_divider {\\n        color: #111B211A;\\n        background-color: #111B211A;\\n      }\\n\\n      .wase_email_body_previous_comment,\\n      .wase_email_body_previous_comment * {\\n        color: #5B6368;\\n      }\\n\\n      a.wase_email_button {\\n        display: block;\\n        width: 100%;\\n        height: 40px;\\n        line-height: 40px;\\n        text-align: center;\\n        background-color: #1DAA61;\\n        color: #FFFFFF;\\n        border-radius: 8px;\\n        text-decoration: none;\\n        font-weight: 500;\\n        margin: 16px 0;\\n      }\\n\\n      a.wase_email_link {\\n        color: #1B8755;\\n      }\\n\\n      @media (min-width: 768px) {\\n        .wase_email_body {\\n          border-radius: 8px;\\n          overflow: hidden;\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark ) {\\n        /* Dark Mode styles */\\n\\n        .tp_body,\\n        .tp_body * {\\n          background-color: #0A1014;\\n        }\\n\\n        .wase_email_header_text,\\n        .wase_email_footer_text {\\n          color: #8D9599;\\n        }\\n\\n        .wase_email_body,\\n        .wase_email_body * {\\n          color: #FFFFFF;\\n          background-color: #20272B;\\n        }\\n\\n        .wase_email_body_divider {\\n          color: #FFFFFF1A;\\n          background-color: #FFFFFF1A;\\n        }\\n\\n        .wase_email_body_previous_comment,\\n        .wase_email_body_previous_comment * {\\n          color: #8D9599;\\n        }\\n\\n        a.wase_email_button {\\n          background-color: #21C063;\\n          color: #0A1014;\\n        }\\n\\n        a.wase_email_link {\\n          color: #21C063;\\n        }\\n      }</style></head><body style=\\\"padding:0;\\\"><table align=\\\"center\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#FCF5EB;width:100%;max-width:100%;min-width:100%;\\\" class=\\\"tp_body\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"><tr align=\\\"center\\\"><td style=\\\"height:0px\\\"></td></tr><tr align=\\\"center\\\"><td align=\\\"center\\\" class=\\\"tp_body_content\\\"><!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]><table align=\\\"center\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"600\\\"><tr><td align=\\\"center\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" width=\\\"600\\\"><![endif]--><table border=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"background-color:#FCF5EB;min-width:360px;max-width:600px;width:100%;\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"><div style=\\\"display: none; max-height: 0px; overflow: hidden;\\\"><span>Pastikan Anda telah memasukkan nomor telepon internasional lengkap, termasuk kode negara. Hapus awalan angka nol (0) atau kode keluar dari nomor telepon. Contoh nomor telepon di Indonesia: +62 813 5553 8777. Jika Anda masih belum menerima kode melalui SMS, coba ketuk &quot;Panggil saya&quot; untuk meminta kode melalui panggilan telepon.\\n\\nPelajari selengkapnya di artikel Pusat Bantuan berikut.\\n* [Tidak Bisa Mendaftar Nomor Telepon](https://faq.whatsapp.com/1369114327051380/?locale=id_ID)</span></div><table align=\\\"center\\